 en from Indore.\nThe Moon is 34° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +14°.\nT
 imes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon'
 s edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Indore
